  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei receives a letter Gu from a recently recruited Heavenly Court Gu Immortal who had been a supreme elder in one of the ten great ancient sects, Yuan Qiong Du. Because he cultivates refinement path, she tasks him with repairing fate Gu. He reports buying year beasts filled with heaven’s will from treasure yellow heaven to use as immortal materials so repair can save time and gain stronger effect.",
      "chapters": [
        1401
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei contacts this newly recruited rank eight Gu Immortal and orders him to refine fixed space Gu again. He had added refinement path dao marks on fixed space Gu and related Gu, so he grasps what the order implies about Liu Hao. He and Liu Hao come from the same ancient sect. He agrees to refine and leaves; as a rank eight Gu Immortal with Heavenly Court’s grand refinement path formation, refining fixed space Immortal Gu is treated as practically certain.",
      "chapters": [
        1611
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fixed-space-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_hao",
        "gu_fixed_space_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong lists Duke Long, Fairy Zi Wei, Yuan Qiong Du, Che Wei, and Cong Yan as fighting in Heavenly Court while arguing that Central Continent’s nine-nine consecutive unceasing formation is thinly manned.",
      "chapters": [
        1730
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-among-heavenly-court-defenders",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_che_wei",
        "char_cong_yan",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration calls him a refinement path expert in charge of repairing fate Gu and says asking him to refine time path Immortal Gu on top of that is too much for one person. Fairy Zi Wei keeps him on fate Gu repair while Heavenly Court rallies other refinement path Gu Immortals for time path Immortal Gu. He feels Fang Yuan’s refinement path pressure most deeply after Lang Ya Sect falls into Fang Yuan’s hands.",
      "chapters": [
        1884
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-gu-work-blocks-other-refinements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a refinement backlash he faints inside Heaven Overseeing Tower and dreams of his youth, when senior sister calls him Little Du for refining a rank three Gu. He obtains a will flame inheritance his water path master left from a fire path youth, later keeps improving will flame to immortal level beside refinement path, and wakes to find will flame still burning as his most skilled Gu refinement method and subconscious failsafe.",
      "chapters": [
        1952
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "will-flame",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When rank nine fate Gu is restored, Heavenly Court Gu Immortals cheer that Yuan Qiong Du did not fail them and that Heaven Overseeing Tower has returned to its peak state.",
      "chapters": [
        1953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-gu-restored",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
